<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{!plan}}" class="empty"><view>先告诉小禾人数、预算和想吃什么。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="guide">去生成采购方案</button></view><block wx:else><view class="title">{{plan.preferences.people}} 人的采购方案</view><view class="subtitle">核对食材与份量，确认后加入清单。</view><view class="budget-panel {{over ? 'over' : ''}}"><view class="row"><view><view class="note">{{pantry ? '待购合计 · 调味待确认' : '整单待购合计'}}</view><view class="big-price">¥{{total}}</view></view><view class="budget-right"><view class="note">{{budget ? '预算 ¥'+budget : '未设置预算上限'}}</view><view>{{remaining ? (over ? '超出 ¥' : '还余 ¥')+remaining : '可继续调整'}}</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{plan.existingCost > 0}}" class="note">包含已有待购清单 ¥{{existing}}；补齐方案预计增加 ¥{{added}}。</view><view class="recipes"><view wx:for="{{plan.recipes}}" wx:key="id" class="recipe"><button class="recipe-header row" bindtap="toggle" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text class="grow">{{item.title}}</text><text class="note">约 {{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{expanded[item.id] ? '收起' : '做法'}}</text></button><view wx:if="{{expanded[item.id]}}" class="recipe-steps"><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:for-index="si" wx:key="*this">{{si+1}}. {{step}}</view></view></view></view><view class="section-title">需要购买 · {{plan.items.length}} 种食材</view><view wx:for="{{plan.items}}" wx:key="id" class="row item-line"><image class="thumb" src="{{item.product.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><view class="item-name">{{item.product.name}}</view><view class="note">{{item.amount}}</view><view class="note">¥{{item.product.priceText}}/{{item.product.unit}} · {{item.product.shelf}}</view></view><text class="line-price">¥{{item.costText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{plan.owned.length}}" class="owned"><text>家中已有 / 清单已购：</text><text wx:for="{{plan.owned}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}；</text><view class="note">不重复购买。</view></view><view wx:if="{{pantry}}" class="pantry"><view class="item-name">还需确认：{{pantry}}</view><view class="note">这些调味未计价。如果需要购买，请回到对话说“{{pantry}}也要买”。</view></view><view wx:if="{{plan.missing.length}}" class="error"><view wx:for="{{plan.missing}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{over}}" class="error">超出整单预算 ¥{{remaining}}，请调整预算或换菜后再确认。</view><view class="actions"><button bindtap="cheaper" disabled="{{busy}}">换便宜一点</button><button class="primary" bindtap="confirm" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !canConfirm}}">{{pantry ? '确认备料已有并加入' : '补齐购物清单'}}</button></view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="route" disabled="{{busy}}">按清单开始导航</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="guide">继续对话调整</button></view><view class="divider"></view><view wx:for="{{plan.notes}}" wx:key="*this" class="note">{{item}}</view></block></view>
